{"id":"word:hebrew:H8354","type":"word","title":"שָׁתָה","subtitle":"H8354 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to imbibe (literally or figuratively)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שָׁתָה (H8354) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 217 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שָׁתָה (shâthâh) means to imbibe (literally or figuratively) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 11 18."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שָׁתָה","transliteration":"shâthâh","pronunciation":"shaw-thaw'","strong":"H8354","lemmaId":"hebrew:H8354","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["לִ/שְׁתּ֥וֹת","וַ/יִּשְׁתּ֔וּ","יִשְׁתּ֖וּ","וַ/יִּשְׁתּֽוּ","לִ/שְׁתּֽוֹת"],"morphs":[["HR/Vqc",23],["HVqi3mp",14],["HC/Vqw3mp",12],["HVqi3ms",12],["HVqi2ms",10],["HC/Vqw3ms",10],["HC/R/Vqc",10],["HC/Vqrmpa",6],["HVqrmsa",6],["HVqa",6]]},"definitions":{"short":"to imbibe (literally or figuratively)","usage":"× assuredly, banquet, × certainly, drink(-er, -ing), drunk (× -ard), surely. (Prop. intensive of 8248 .)","full":"H8354. shathah I. שָׁתָה 217 verb drink (Late Hebrew id. ; Assyrian šatû , Ethiopic Old Aramaic שתה , Aramaic אִשְׁתִּי שְׁתָא, , [], ; Sabean שתי DHM ZMG xxxvii (1883), 403 Hom Chr 124 ); — Qal 216 Perfect 3masculine singular ׳שׁ Exod 34:28 +, 1 singular שָׁתִ֫יתִי 1Sam 1:15 +, etc.; Imperfect 3masculine singular יִשְׁתֶּה Gen 44:5 +, וַיִּשְׁתֶּה 1Kin 19:8 , usually וַיֵּשְׁתְּ Gen 9:21 +; jussive וְיֵשְׁתְּ 1Kin 13:18 ; 3 feminine singular וַתֵּשְׁתְּ Num 20:11 ; 2 masculine singular with apocope תֵּשְׁתְּ Judg 13:14 +, וַתֵּשְׁתְּ 1Kin 13:22 ; 1 singular וָאֵשְׁתְּ Gen 24:46 ; 3 masculine plural יִשְׁתָּי֑וּן Psa 78:44 , etc.; Imperative masculine singular שְׁתֵה Gen 24:14 +, etc.; Infinitive absolute שָׁתֹה Isa 21:5 ; Jer 49:12 (in 1Sam 1:9 after preposition, anomalous, Ges § 113e , omitted by ᵐ5 Th We Dr and modern), שָׁתוֺ Jer 25:28 +, שָׁתוֺת Isa 22:13 (Ges § 75n ); construct תְוֺ Prov 31:4 , שְׁתוֺת Jer 35:8 , 14 , לִשְׁתּתֹ Gen 24:19 +, suffix שְׁתוֺתוֺ 1Kin 13:33 , לִשְׁתּוֺתָהּ Isa 51:22 etc.; Participle active שֹׁתֶה 29:8 +, feminine שֹׁתָה Job 6:4 , etc.; &#8212; 1. a. of man: drink , water, wine, etc., Exod 34:28 (JE), compare 15:24 (J), 1Sam 30:12 ; Amos 2:8 ; 4:8 ; 5:11 ; Isa 5:22 ; 62:8-9 , Prov 31:4 ; Judg 13:4 , 7 , 14 + often (2 t. J E; 6 t. D); by measure (short allowance) Ezek 4:11 , 16 ; milk 25:4 , compare Song 5:1 ; blood 1Chr 11:19 (figurative of water gained by hazard); figurative רוּחִי שֹׁתָה חֲמָתָם Job 6:4 whose venom [of arrows of ׳י ] my spirit drinks up ; accusative + מִן of source Exod 7:18 (J), 7:21 (E), 15:23 (J), Prov 5:15 (figurative); accusative (of wine, water, etc.) omitted Gen 24:14 (twice in verse); 27:25 ; 43:34 (all J) + 11 t. J, Exod 7:24 ; 17:6 (E), Num 20:5 (JE), 20:11 ; 33:14 (P), Judg 15:19 + often; accusative שׁין 2Kin 18:27 = Isa 36:12 ; מַמְתַקִּים Neh 8:10 ; absolute Eccl 2:24 +; + מִן of source 1Kin 17:4 , 6 ; Psa 110:7 , מִכֹּסוֺ 2Sam 12:3 ; ׳שׁ יַיִן בְּמִזְרְקֵי Amos 6:6 , compare Gen 44:5 ; ׳שׁ בְּיַיִן Prov 9:5 ; c. מִן partitive Gen 9:21 ; Exod 7:24 ; Ruth 2:9 , also (figurative) Jer 51:7 (and Job 21:20 infra). b. participle as substantive מַיִם שֹׁתֵי Ezek 31:14 , 16 , יַיִן שֹׁתֵי Joel 1:5 ; שֵׁכָר שׁוֺתֵי Psa 69:13 . c. drink wine in sacrificial feast Deut 32:38 (poem); blood of sacrificial victim Psa 50:13 (figurative of ׳י ). d. subject animals Num 20:19 ; Jonah 3:7 (both + men), also (figurative) Ezek 34:18-19 , accusative (water) omitted Gen 24:19 , 22 ; 30:38 (twice in verse). e. figurative of drinking cup of ׳י s wrath, חֲמָתוֺ ׳שׁ אֶתאכּוֺס Isa 51:17 (+ י ׳מִיַּד ), compare 51:17 , 51:22 , see also Ezek 23:32 , 34 and (accusative omitted) Jer 25:16 , 26 , 27 8 t. Jeremiah; Hab 2:16 ; absolute Obadiah 16 (3 t. in verse); accusative שְׁמָרִים Psa 75:9 ; ׳שׁ שַׁדַּי מֵחֲמַת Job 21:20 . f. drink blood, figurative of slaughter, Num 23:24 (J E; of lion, metaphor of Israel), Zech 9:15 (read דָּמָם for ᵐ5 הָמוּ Manuscripts Sta Now Marti); so (blood of ׳י s sacrifice) Ezek 39:17-18 , 19 . g. figurative of wicked deeds: יִשְׁתּוּ חֲמָסִים יֵין Prov 4:17 (|| רֶשַׁע לֶחֶם לָֽחֲמוּ ; these are their food and drink), compare Job 15:16 ; 34:7 , but Prov 26:6 apparently = suffers violence (compare De Toy). 2 late , = feast Est 3:15 ; 7:1 (compare מִשְׁתֶּה ). Niph`al Imperfect 3masculine singular יִשָּׁתֶה Lev 11:34 (P) all which is (may be) drunk , with ב of vessel. &#8212; נִשְׁתָּ֑וָה Prov 27:15 see I. שׁוה near the end For cause, give, to drink see שׁקה .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 11 18","keyReferences":["1Chr 11 18","1Chr 11 19","1Chr 11 19","1Chr 12 40","1Chr 29 22","1Kgs 1 25","1Kgs 4 20","1Kgs 13 8"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":217,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 11 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/שְׁתּוֹתָ֔/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vqc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 11 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֶשְׁתֶּ֤ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqi1cs"},{"reference":"1Chr 11 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/שְׁתּוֹתָ֑/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vqc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 40","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":40,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שׁוֹתִ֑ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 29 22","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּשְׁתּ֜וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3mp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֹׁתִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 4 20","book":"1Kgs","chapter":4,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/שֹׁתִ֖ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqrmpa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 13 8","book":"1Kgs"